        <p>have entirely disappeared. I hay(' continued to take Hood's Sarsaparilla and can say that I am now is the best of health, doing all my housework and thinking nothing oi it, whereas formerly I had to employ a f15.-nestic. Myself and husband have such faith in Hood's Sarsaparilla that we do not intend to he without a bottle in the house, and shall recom- mend it to ati our friends." CLARA ADAMSON, 17, Southgates, Leicester.</p>
