        <p>Price 2s. 9i1.; double size, 43. 63.; cues of three large bottles, 123. 6d.; sample bottles, is. il. Sold by all Chemists and Vendors of Patent Medicines in the kingdom. Agents in all parts of the world. Equally suited for all climates. Proprietors, Quinine Bitters Manufacturing Co., Limited, Lianelly, South Wales.</p>
