      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1895-10-05_WidnesExaminer_art0104" n="art0104">
        <head>FOOTBA</head>
        <p>FOOTBA</p>
        <p>t 1 HO. G. HUSSEY &amp; CO., are the leading makers of appli- ..X ances for Football, Hockey. Golf, Lacrosse and all Sports and Games,also for Gymnasium and Physical Exercises. Illustrated Catalogue m La, be obtained from Local Dealers or the SPORTS MsItUFLOTORY, London S.D.</p>
